                                                "example_id": "2703634d-77f3-4d54-aa0e-d663c6b26787",
                                                "sense_id": "b97492fc-5db3-39e2-81de-e6289d029d3a",
                                                "text": "It has been reported that periparturient cows undergo a period of immunosuppression of various immunological parameters associated with a high susceptibility to uterine and mammary infections […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
